abstract: >-
  HeritageGate implements an eight-stage workflow with normalized rights,
  authorization, cultural-element, model-run, expert-review, market-test,
  and revenue-distribution records; provenance links; role-specific gate
  validation; a local browser interface; privacy-aware participant enrollment; reproducible pilot analysis; and GitHub, Zenodo, and SoftwareX submission-release preparation.
